<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">西班牙11月11日爆发全国性大罢工和示威活动。<br/>此次大罢工由西班牙工人委员会和劳工总联盟组织发起，呼吁解决住房成本上涨、工资购买力下降等问题，并要求改善公共服务。<br/>工会表示，全国范围内约400万人参加罢工。西班牙各地的交通和公共服务严重中断。多地爆发罢工者与警方冲突，超50人被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.news.cn/20261112/ab9e2ec730e041e290450ec0ff7fbc75/c.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">新华社</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/11/europe/spain-strike-housing-latam-intl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Z-QbTXLmMSi1ppA2ZZv1fb0rXPhA09FX5c1upAAsXNsJSr-pXQ8DVLm-krmN2IkE65LiA0SEPgVyBbuL66Qo5WBNY2vso9uYTyuaU04lN3DsAWDoG7T2QHVoOGpn7-gy7sWWRm2Kw3wuH7VDAqdHIVfCM7sjeUvFzkd3JiNZHFjq-bmRmapdKLzhCZ3BH6Lr5LiFPkeGJFyMuJUmXYo7E5xlgunO8NMCLnYJDCQ1kc8lwKMt8tzrbQv_nVfpkFt2KI6avoiXpXMZcXkpYUAqq_wjJwZqjsmLeJNIO9NE-S-PiAT7rSYJmLYVzQcAlO8DIfFekgYjhSQEJOUjE46-eA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ves9pDHkoJ6W1-cuQtZv5cp9kvY2ZHl2hYfuzlreOYEWVn8SLw9Zsqn7KWWBeGyvwbpGARMAiNAy_0j42ujBGNm0p6U_5T-6MgSintfg90vKlcGIactfuiPPQ22HHox9IeXi-106hwwpQrOjKLSTJBxtHIhW4eWwMS_S8pluMLjT69frwzPiZenCZvaaFIECrfnbalDt78lq3xFnrSuSGwaph_qf9fWpcS5t3KSP0p717z2qtlQvh-UrIVYI-QOmAR03AACQIreKKBlc03E2Y0cg-3fueB5oOoYXzpntqUI0FSEHP4M7QHggquLcaiKf54uTFBieaWnakR_Z3BXj7Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/AehxaXqNZ3lsPyDHH2KakPqwXkIePfMoX8LSJphI98leWq-_dferg0fnIxKDCFPgdajYZJ-4oZBIY6VKSiEZoi5DuHi0rQEc0457Vg4JpjuxeWeIlTk1uNuESu6wbfrsUj6Msw5vP0cDyJEsG-XBzYoLTD4_W6tGD0SkBp7oT0RjCoHaMl9jlHYblJ5MmgEXwB_se85kSsYookT2BaBcapQZbaB32r6zaIJVXtt-qBPRTCsj8EFPPDZbhQztorPUSb9V8B1g6zKKWM1t4Boy93Onq0lLu1x0n1b3tXUEJ88bQvbm6BHlOZkRxgDrR-XakV_ad3bKLwk9wutLo9TMyg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%